    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Your mastery keeps certain spells always at the ready. Once you have spell slots of a level shown in the Necromancy Adept Spells table, you always have the spells of that level and lower prepared.</p><p><strong>Life Manipulation.</strong> When you cast a Necromancy spell with a spell slot, you can immediately roll up to two of your unexpended Hit Point Dice. You regain Hit Points equal to the total plus the level of the spell slot expended. Those Hit Point Dice are then expended.</p><h4>Necromancy Adept Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Spell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInflictWou]{Inflict Wounds}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRayofEnfee]{Ray of Enfeeblement}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplVampiricTo]{Vampiric Touch}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlight0000]{Blight}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRaiseDead0]{Raise Dead}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GNK0JwL5lpVsSrOb\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spells of the levels whose slots you have; add the others when you gain those slots. <em>Life Manipulation</em> spends and rolls two of your largest Hit Point Dice and adds 1: replace the 1 with the slot level in the roll dialog.</p></section>",
